  {
    "name": "thread",
    "description": "A discussion and a page of compact posts, with attachment links. Use when: discussion posts. Not for: news for announcements. Refs: discussion_id; offset and limit. Then: increase offset while posts_total exceeds returned. Cost: up to 20 posts by default.",
